---
title: Cluster
description: Horizontal layout primitive that wraps children onto new lines with even gaps. Good for tags, button groups and toolbars. Use --cluster-space and --cluster-justify to adjust.
tags: [layout, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<div class="cluster" style="--cluster-space: 0.5rem">
  <span>One</span>
  <span>Two</span>
  <span>Three</span>
  <span>Four</span>
</div>
